    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_400.parts.ii :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ᵉ (k ≥ 2), ∃ c : ℝ, ∀ ε > 0,\n      Tendsto (fun x : ℕ ↦\n        (((Icc 1 x).filter (fun n ↦\n          |(g k n : ℝ) - c * Real.log x| ≤ ε * Real.log x)).card : ℝ) / x)\n        atTop (𝓝 1)",
